= Introduction

Sleep deprivation is a prevalent issue in modern academic environments.
Undergraduate students frequently report sleep disturbances that may impair
their working memory capacity and cognitive functioning.

== Methodology

Participants completed a series of standardized memory assessment tasks
following a night of restricted sleep.
